1
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:06,172
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:13,388 --> 00:00:15,306
[laughs]

3
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:36,911
[Lily] <i>Just a little longer,</i>
<i>and we'll finally be free.</i>

4
00:00:36,995 --> 00:00:38,621
<i>We can finally be together.</i>

5
00:00:38,705 --> 00:00:39,873
[Diego] <i>I can't wait anymore.</i>

6
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:42,584
[Helena] <i>All my money got incinerated!</i>

7
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:45,795
<i>Why not? All those booby traps</i>
<i>you set were all defective!</i>

8
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:47,964
<i>That's the reason why the fire started!</i>

9
00:00:48,047 --> 00:00:50,091
[Magbanua] <i>That happened in the next town.</i>
<i>Someone made it rain money.</i>

10
00:00:50,175 --> 00:00:52,761
<i>Do you know who's behind this?</i>

11
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:56,264
[Magbanua] <i>Our people</i>
<i>saw Lily Cruz and Diego Torillo</i>

12
00:00:56,347 --> 00:00:58,308
<i>giving your money away to the people.</i>

13
00:00:58,391 --> 00:01:00,310
[Diego] <i>I have to go.</i>
<i>I've got something to do.</i>

14
00:01:00,393 --> 00:01:01,394
<i>Somewhere special.</i>

15
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:02,645
<i>Do you mean you'll propose to her?</i>

16
00:01:02,729 --> 00:01:05,732
[Diego] <i>I'll tell you about it</i>
<i>tomorrow. I have to go.</i>

17
00:01:05,815 --> 00:01:07,317
-[Arnaldo] <i>Sure thing. Take care!</i>
<i>-</i>[Diego] <i>Take care!</i>

18
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:09,861
[Lily] <i>Whatever happens tomorrow</i>
<i>or in the days to come,</i>

19
00:01:09,944 --> 00:01:11,571
<i>there's only one thing I'm sure of.</i>

20
00:01:11,654 --> 00:01:13,239
<i>We'll always be together.</i>

21
00:01:13,323 --> 00:01:15,575
<i>I was planning on giving this to Lily.</i>

22
00:01:15,658 --> 00:01:17,744
<i>I'll only propose to her</i>
<i>if you give me your blessing.</i>

23
00:01:17,827 --> 00:01:19,954
<i>Of course, you have my blessing!</i>

24
00:01:20,789 --> 00:01:23,875
[Emilia] <i>Mama and I</i>
<i>have a job for you. Let's go.</i>

25
00:01:23,958 --> 00:01:27,504
[Julio] <i>I will help you crush Lily Cruz.</i>

26
00:01:27,587 --> 00:01:30,507
<i>We have to help each other.</i>

27
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:32,342
-[Julio laughs]
-[Emilia] Aw!

28
00:01:33,009 --> 00:01:35,011
[Emilia] <i>I love my family.</i>

29
00:01:40,433 --> 00:01:43,770
Papa, I heard Mama's money
has been burnt to ashes.

30
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:45,939
[sighs] That's right.

31
00:01:46,022 --> 00:01:49,234
[tsks] So, what now?

32
00:01:50,110 --> 00:01:54,197
The wealth you've been
gloating about. It's all gone.

33
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:55,323
[chuckles]

34
00:01:57,033 --> 00:02:00,453
Do you know who burned the money?

35
00:02:01,913 --> 00:02:09,295
Lily Cruz and your bastard son, Diego.

36
00:02:10,547 --> 00:02:13,216
He just signed his death sentence.

37
00:02:14,843 --> 00:02:16,261
So, go after my son then.

38
00:02:17,512 --> 00:02:21,099
But if you do, you'll have to
answer to me. I swear it.

39
00:02:21,182 --> 00:02:22,392
[chuckles]

40
00:02:23,768 --> 00:02:27,689
You know, Raul, you shouldn't make
promises you can't really keep.

41
00:02:28,940 --> 00:02:32,735
Why don't you just stick
to what you're actually good at?

42
00:02:33,778 --> 00:02:35,488
Womanizing!

43
00:02:36,614 --> 00:02:38,616
[laughs]

44
00:02:46,499 --> 00:02:50,962
You know, Raul, I can
define you in four letters.

45
00:02:52,255 --> 00:02:54,632
NG and GN.

46
00:02:56,634 --> 00:03:00,388
No good, and good-for-nothing.

47
00:03:01,014 --> 00:03:02,724
[laughs]

48
00:03:03,892 --> 00:03:05,476
[continues laughing]

49
00:03:06,769 --> 00:03:07,812
[Julio sighs]

50
00:03:12,191 --> 00:03:14,736
[woman] Red Dragon won't be
happy to hear about this.

51
00:03:16,279 --> 00:03:18,656
I've served her almost my whole life.

52
00:03:19,282 --> 00:03:22,118
I think she would respect my decision…

53
00:03:23,328 --> 00:03:26,205
to retire and live in peace.

54
00:03:26,456 --> 00:03:27,665
Why are you doing this?!

55
00:03:27,999 --> 00:03:30,877
Red Dragon gave you everything you needed!

56
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,712
You're living a good life because of her!

57
00:03:34,505 --> 00:03:35,673
Why are you leaving?

58
00:03:36,424 --> 00:03:39,928
This isn't the life I want
for my loved ones.

59
00:03:43,056 --> 00:03:46,768
Tell Madam Red Dragon to start
looking for my replacement.

60
00:03:47,894 --> 00:03:51,648
I don't want to be the Jaguar.
And I'm done being a criminal.

61
00:03:52,273 --> 00:03:53,983
[tense music playing]

62
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:11,292
Move!

63
00:04:20,176 --> 00:04:22,178
[soft instrumental playing]

64
00:04:43,199 --> 00:04:44,575
<i>You'll enjoy this date.</i>

65
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:48,871
<i>-Oh, really?</i>
<i>-Yeah. I'll make sure of that.</i>

66
00:04:48,955 --> 00:04:50,415
<i>Where are we going?</i>

67
00:06:13,206 --> 00:06:16,667
<i>Lily. Thanks for helping me out.</i>

68
00:06:17,126 --> 00:06:19,128
<i>No worries. I got you! </i>[chuckles]

69
00:06:41,901 --> 00:06:44,112
-[Diego] <i>How do I look?</i>
-[Loring] <i>Great!</i>

70
00:06:44,487 --> 00:06:48,157
<i>That's the Diego we know.</i>
<i>He never gives up.</i>

71
00:06:49,408 --> 00:06:51,285
<i>No matter how many times</i>
<i>she turns me down.</i>

72
00:06:51,369 --> 00:06:52,662
<i>You'll never say die!</i>

73
00:06:52,745 --> 00:06:53,579
[Pandoy and Loring laugh]

74
00:06:53,663 --> 00:06:54,914
<i>I love her.</i>

75
00:06:58,501 --> 00:06:59,544
Nanny, Uncle…

76
00:07:03,047 --> 00:07:04,590
I wish you were here.

77
00:07:12,682 --> 00:07:13,683
[exhales]

78
00:07:25,278 --> 00:07:27,280
[romantic music playing]

79
00:08:14,827 --> 00:08:15,828
You look beautiful.

80
00:08:18,122 --> 00:08:19,123
Charmer.

81
00:08:23,586 --> 00:08:25,087
[Lily] This place looks nice.

82
00:08:27,924 --> 00:08:29,133
You look even better.

83
00:08:29,425 --> 00:08:30,885
[chuckles lightly]

84
00:08:34,472 --> 00:08:35,556
Thank you.

85
00:08:49,195 --> 00:08:50,279
What?

86
00:08:52,198 --> 00:08:53,324
Come on.

87
00:08:54,325 --> 00:08:56,327
-Thank you.
-I wanted to set things up

88
00:08:56,410 --> 00:08:57,662
in our secret garden, but it rained.

89
00:08:59,914 --> 00:09:02,750
-This place is nice too.
-And you really are beautiful.

90
00:09:02,833 --> 00:09:03,709
[Lily chuckles]

91
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:07,505
Diego. Really, this place looks great.

92
00:09:09,006 --> 00:09:10,258
Not compared to you.

93
00:09:14,470 --> 00:09:17,473
Fritters? Fried bananas?

94
00:09:18,975 --> 00:09:20,059
That's our favorite.

95
00:09:21,269 --> 00:09:24,397
Nanny Loring used to cook that, remember?

96
00:09:25,982 --> 00:09:30,570
Yes. How could I forget, Diego?
Actually, now I remember

97
00:09:30,653 --> 00:09:34,824
why you had such chubby cheeks back then.

98
00:09:36,492 --> 00:09:39,745
You couldn't stop eating fritters.

99
00:09:39,829 --> 00:09:41,414
Your cheeks were so cute.

100
00:09:42,707 --> 00:09:44,584
Wow! I wasn't expecting a throwback photo.

101
00:09:48,337 --> 00:09:49,589
Imagine, Lily.

102
00:09:51,966 --> 00:09:53,676
We've been through a lot.

103
00:09:55,678 --> 00:09:57,430
We've been together for a long time.

104
00:10:00,933 --> 00:10:04,687
But then, the reason why we're here…

105
00:10:05,855 --> 00:10:07,940
is because I have something
important to tell you.

106
00:10:11,902 --> 00:10:16,407
I know you still want us
to finish the fight…

107
00:10:18,367 --> 00:10:21,037
before we fulfill our promises
to one another.

108
00:10:21,787 --> 00:10:26,709
But, Lily, what if something happens
tomorrow or the next day?

109
00:10:26,792 --> 00:10:29,462
What if we don't have a happy ever after?

110
00:10:29,545 --> 00:10:30,588
Diego.

111
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:35,217
What are you talking about?
Don't say that.

112
00:10:35,718 --> 00:10:38,888
Lily, we can't know for sure.
You know that, right?

113
00:10:45,227 --> 00:10:47,021
We don't have any control over the future.

114
00:10:49,732 --> 00:10:51,484
But we have tonight.

115
00:10:54,570 --> 00:10:58,407
I'll prove to you that, despite
the challenges in life,

116
00:10:58,491 --> 00:11:00,034
we can still keep loving each other.

117
00:11:01,243 --> 00:11:03,663
Lily, I already lost you once.

118
00:11:05,539 --> 00:11:07,416
I don't want to lose you again.

119
00:11:10,628 --> 00:11:14,548
You won't. You won't
lose me again. I promise.

120
00:11:18,427 --> 00:11:23,140
I want to spend the rest of
my life with my best friend.

121
00:11:26,310 --> 00:11:27,520
You're everything to me.

122
00:11:47,415 --> 00:11:50,751
[upbeat romantic instrumental]

123
00:12:27,997 --> 00:12:28,998
Lily Cruz…

124
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:37,006
Will you marry me?

125
00:12:37,965 --> 00:12:42,261
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" by playing]

126
00:13:00,488 --> 00:13:01,489
Will you??

127
00:13:07,703 --> 00:13:08,871
I will…

128
00:13:12,708 --> 00:13:13,918
Of course!

129
00:13:18,464 --> 00:13:20,382
Yes, I'll marry you.

130
00:13:22,593 --> 00:13:26,680
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" continues playing]

131
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:32,746
I love you so much, Lily.

132
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:36,417
I love you too, Diego.

133
00:14:36,876 --> 00:14:40,629
["Hindi Kita Iiwan" continues playing]

134
00:15:59,917 --> 00:16:02,670
[song fades]

135
00:16:03,712 --> 00:16:05,714
[ominous music playing]

136
00:16:07,925 --> 00:16:11,011
[Diego] You might be hungry. Let's eat.

137
00:16:33,575 --> 00:16:37,454
<i>Go on. Have your moment.</i>

138
00:16:38,414 --> 00:16:40,958
<i>I'll give you tonight.</i>

139
00:16:41,375 --> 00:16:46,630
<i>But, tomorrow is a whole different story.</i>

140
00:17:12,406 --> 00:17:13,824
Camia, I want you to--

141
00:17:14,408 --> 00:17:16,869
I want you to know that I'm the Jaguar.

142
00:17:17,411 --> 00:17:20,998
[soft piano music playing]

143
00:17:51,028 --> 00:17:52,029
Damian.

144
00:17:56,116 --> 00:17:57,117
You're so beautiful.

145
00:17:59,453 --> 00:18:00,454
Shall we sit?

146
00:18:25,395 --> 00:18:26,522
Thank you.

147
00:18:52,840 --> 00:18:53,632
Damian?

148
00:18:55,592 --> 00:18:58,554
Why? Is there something wrong?

149
00:19:03,642 --> 00:19:05,769
Camia, I need to tell you something.

150
00:19:06,687 --> 00:19:07,896
I don't want to hurt you.

151
00:19:08,814 --> 00:19:10,274
So, before anything else,

152
00:19:10,357 --> 00:19:13,527
I want you to know that
I haven't been honest with you.

153
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:15,237
[pensive music]

154
00:19:16,446 --> 00:19:17,948
What do you mean?

155
00:19:20,826 --> 00:19:22,744
I never stopped being a criminal.

156
00:19:27,040 --> 00:19:29,376
I'm the Jaguar, I worked for Red Dragon.

157
00:19:30,919 --> 00:19:31,920
[exhales]

158
00:19:41,096 --> 00:19:42,097
Camia, wait.

159
00:19:45,392 --> 00:19:46,435
Please forgive me.

160
00:19:47,019 --> 00:19:50,397
[pensive music continues]

161
00:20:07,414 --> 00:20:08,457
Camia.

162
00:20:13,754 --> 00:20:14,755
[whispering] Camia.

163
00:20:34,900 --> 00:20:36,568
[tense music playing]

164
00:20:38,111 --> 00:20:41,073
The once fearless Jaguar…

165
00:20:41,615 --> 00:20:43,825
has now turned into a scared kitten.

166
00:20:44,993 --> 00:20:45,994
No worries.

167
00:20:46,912 --> 00:20:50,457
I'm going to take
both of you out of your misery.

168
00:20:57,881 --> 00:21:00,467
[somber music playing]

169
00:21:20,737 --> 00:21:23,031
[Damian] <i>Camia, is there</i>
<i>anything I can do to help?</i>

170
00:21:23,115 --> 00:21:24,825
<i>I'll do anything for you and Lily.</i>

171
00:21:25,909 --> 00:21:28,328
<i>Camia, believe me. I've changed.</i>

172
00:21:28,412 --> 00:21:30,914
<i>I'm not a criminal anymore.</i>

173
00:21:31,498 --> 00:21:34,501
<i>I live a completely different life now.</i>

174
00:21:35,252 --> 00:21:36,962
<i>These people are on a different level.</i>

175
00:21:37,212 --> 00:21:41,133
<i>Why, Damian? Do you know Mercedes Palacio?</i>

176
00:21:42,342 --> 00:21:43,927
<i>No, I don't know her.</i>

177
00:21:44,344 --> 00:21:46,263
<i>Do you know anything about Red Dragon?</i>

178
00:21:46,346 --> 00:21:49,141
<i>Are you part of Red Dragon's syndicate?</i>

179
00:21:49,391 --> 00:21:51,393
<i>No. But I know of Red Dragon.</i>

180
00:21:51,768 --> 00:21:54,646
<i>Damian, don't forget we all love you.</i>

181
00:21:56,148 --> 00:21:58,150
<i>Whatever it is you're going through,</i>

182
00:21:58,233 --> 00:22:00,652
<i>remember that we're ready</i>
<i>to fight with you,</i>

183
00:22:00,736 --> 00:22:02,237
<i>as long as you stay true to us.</i>

184
00:22:47,532 --> 00:22:51,411
-Mom? Mom.
-Lily.

185
00:22:56,208 --> 00:22:58,251
So, how did your date go?

186
00:23:00,921 --> 00:23:03,507
-It was fine, Mom.
-Just "fine"?

187
00:23:04,341 --> 00:23:05,509
Wasn't he--

188
00:23:09,805 --> 00:23:12,808
What are you hiding back there?
Show me your hand.

189
00:23:13,350 --> 00:23:18,396
-It's nothing, Mom. Really.
-Come on, let me see. Show me.

190
00:23:19,147 --> 00:23:20,190
[soft music playing]

191
00:23:20,273 --> 00:23:21,149
[exhales]

192
00:23:28,156 --> 00:23:30,575
Diego and I are getting married.

193
00:23:33,286 --> 00:23:35,539
I'm so happy for you, Lily!

194
00:23:36,665 --> 00:23:39,543
And I'm sure your father is too.

195
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:46,675
I wish he was still here with us, Mom.

196
00:23:48,218 --> 00:23:50,262
I miss him so much.

197
00:23:51,721 --> 00:23:53,598
I miss him very much too.

198
00:24:00,939 --> 00:24:03,483
How did your dinner with Uncle Damian go?

199
00:24:04,985 --> 00:24:06,194
It was fine too. Lily.

200
00:24:16,955 --> 00:24:17,831
My dear…

201
00:24:18,915 --> 00:24:21,835
Cherish the love you and Diego hold, okay?

202
00:24:23,420 --> 00:24:26,423
I want you to show the world

203
00:24:27,132 --> 00:24:29,301
that there is no force greater than love.

204
00:24:35,682 --> 00:24:36,850
We will, Mom.

205
00:24:37,893 --> 00:24:39,477
I believe we will.

206
00:24:40,103 --> 00:24:41,146
I have faith.

207
00:24:44,983 --> 00:24:47,777
Honestly, dear,
I've already seen this ring.

208
00:24:49,487 --> 00:24:52,866
I spoke to Diego.
I knew he was going to propose.

209
00:24:52,949 --> 00:24:55,035
What? Why didn't you tell me?

210
00:24:55,118 --> 00:24:58,288
That would've ruined
the surprise! [laughs]

211
00:25:02,250 --> 00:25:04,419
I'm so happy for you, Lily.

212
00:25:05,962 --> 00:25:07,339
I am too, Mom.

213
00:25:09,174 --> 00:25:12,761
I'm so excited to be Diego's wife.

214
00:25:12,844 --> 00:25:13,887
[giggles]

215
00:25:36,743 --> 00:25:38,411
<i>Sir! Let me go!</i>

216
00:25:38,495 --> 00:25:39,454
[pot breaks]

217
00:25:47,504 --> 00:25:52,050
[Raul] <i>I just want you to know</i>
<i>that nobody can keep us apart.</i>

218
00:25:52,384 --> 00:25:54,386
[Camia screams]

219
00:26:56,031 --> 00:26:58,908
<i>Dante, please forgive me</i>
<i>for hurting Camia.</i>

220
00:27:11,421 --> 00:27:14,966
<i>I know you made our paths cross</i>
<i>again so I could protect her.</i>

221
00:27:16,051 --> 00:27:18,887
<i>But I didn't expect my feelings</i>
<i>for her to return.</i>

222
00:27:20,055 --> 00:27:23,725
<i>You used to say there's</i>
<i>always hope for change.</i>

223
00:27:24,934 --> 00:27:26,895
<i>And now I know I'm ready to. For Camia.</i>

224
00:27:28,396 --> 00:27:31,107
<i>I just pray she gives me another chance.</i>

225
00:27:31,191 --> 00:27:33,485
<i>I hope she can forgive me</i>
<i>for all my mistakes.</i>

226
00:27:53,755 --> 00:27:55,423
[somber music playing]

227
00:28:03,098 --> 00:28:04,140
Mom…

228
00:28:11,773 --> 00:28:14,150
Mom. What's wrong?

229
00:28:14,567 --> 00:28:15,860
Why are you crying?

230
00:28:17,404 --> 00:28:18,446
It's nothing.

231
00:28:20,031 --> 00:28:21,616
It doesn't look like it.

232
00:28:21,699 --> 00:28:23,827
What happened? Tell me what's wrong.

233
00:28:30,333 --> 00:28:31,418
Lily…

234
00:28:33,628 --> 00:28:35,964
Your Uncle Damian told me something.

235
00:28:39,175 --> 00:28:40,552
He's the Jaguar.

236
00:28:41,845 --> 00:28:43,930
He worked for Red Dragon.

237
00:28:48,977 --> 00:28:50,937
[soft instrumental playing]

238
00:28:54,065 --> 00:28:56,151
It all makes sense now, Mom.

239
00:29:00,113 --> 00:29:02,490
Now I know why the Jaguar saved me

240
00:29:02,574 --> 00:29:05,368
when I was buried alive by the Ardientes.

241
00:29:08,455 --> 00:29:10,498
Before Diego and the others found me,

242
00:29:11,374 --> 00:29:13,084
Uncle Damian was at the scene.

243
00:29:13,501 --> 00:29:15,503
Jaguar was there, he saved me.

244
00:29:18,631 --> 00:29:20,341
It all makes sense now.

245
00:29:24,596 --> 00:29:26,139
And if you think about it…

246
00:29:27,766 --> 00:29:30,435
Uncle Damian sacrificed a lot for us.

247
00:29:34,606 --> 00:29:37,650
He helped me bring down Red Dragon.

248
00:29:41,738 --> 00:29:43,239
He protected you.

249
00:29:44,073 --> 00:29:47,368
He protected me… and our entire family.

250
00:29:51,289 --> 00:29:55,335
That's why even though he lied to us,

251
00:29:55,668 --> 00:29:57,962
and kept secrets from us…

252
00:30:01,007 --> 00:30:03,092
I'm grateful to him.

253
00:30:06,095 --> 00:30:07,764
He looks out for us.

254
00:30:08,973 --> 00:30:11,226
He protects us, Mom.

255
00:30:15,396 --> 00:30:17,148
But it still hurts, Lily.

256
00:30:18,608 --> 00:30:20,819
And I know you feel the same way.

257
00:30:23,696 --> 00:30:25,657
But if there's one thing I'm sure of,

258
00:30:25,740 --> 00:30:28,076
it's that your uncle
is changing for the better.

259
00:30:35,834 --> 00:30:40,046
He's doing it for us.

260
00:30:41,840 --> 00:30:43,883
Because we're what's left of his family.

261
00:30:48,304 --> 00:30:50,223
Can you still forgive him, Mom?

262
00:30:55,270 --> 00:30:57,146
He did ask me for my forgiveness.

263
00:31:00,149 --> 00:31:02,402
Then can you still trust him?

264
00:31:25,508 --> 00:31:27,427
-Diego.
-Mr. Damian.

265
00:31:28,428 --> 00:31:29,888
Is Camia around?

266
00:31:30,471 --> 00:31:32,432
She's inside, talking to Lily.

267
00:31:33,099 --> 00:31:34,142
Please, come in.

268
00:31:39,355 --> 00:31:42,233
Is something wrong?

269
00:31:45,069 --> 00:31:46,696
I made a terrible mistake.

270
00:32:03,588 --> 00:32:06,382
Lily. Auntie.

271
00:32:09,177 --> 00:32:10,720
Mr. Damian is outside.

272
00:32:15,725 --> 00:32:20,188
[soft instrumental playing]

273
00:32:29,864 --> 00:32:31,783
[music fading]

274
00:32:31,866 --> 00:32:32,867
[door opens]

275
00:32:34,327 --> 00:32:37,121
[somber music playing]

276
00:32:53,513 --> 00:32:55,390
Thank you for agreeing to talk to me.

277
00:32:59,936 --> 00:33:02,188
I came here to tell you how sorry I am.

278
00:33:06,651 --> 00:33:08,486
Camia, can you ever forgive me?

279
00:33:15,076 --> 00:33:17,203
What you're asking for isn't easy, Damian.

280
00:33:22,959 --> 00:33:24,335
I understand.

281
00:33:26,295 --> 00:33:27,296
But I want you to know

282
00:33:27,380 --> 00:33:30,091
I won't stop asking for your forgiveness.

283
00:33:32,010 --> 00:33:33,428
From you and Lily.

284
00:33:36,931 --> 00:33:39,434
I hope you can forgive me one day.

285
00:33:53,239 --> 00:33:55,199
[ominous music playing]

286
00:34:08,921 --> 00:34:09,922
Get down!

287
00:34:12,925 --> 00:34:14,844
[gunfire]

288
00:34:45,792 --> 00:34:47,293
-[Lily] Mom.
-[Damian] Wait!

289
00:34:47,376 --> 00:34:48,211
-Wait!
-No! No!

290
00:34:48,294 --> 00:34:49,378
-Who are you?
-No, wait!

291
00:34:51,631 --> 00:34:52,381
[Lily] Diego.

292
00:34:52,465 --> 00:34:54,926
[tense music playing]

293
00:34:58,930 --> 00:34:59,931
[Camia] Lily!

294
00:35:03,267 --> 00:35:04,310
[grunts]

295
00:35:19,408 --> 00:35:21,536
-Come here.
-Let go of me!

296
00:35:21,619 --> 00:35:24,038
-Hey!
-Lily!

297
00:35:25,206 --> 00:35:26,749
-Mom, run!
-Lily, I can't just leave you!

298
00:35:26,833 --> 00:35:29,836
-Go, now!
-It's dangerous here. Go on, Mom!

299
00:35:29,919 --> 00:35:30,962
Lily!

300
00:35:31,045 --> 00:35:32,922
[dramatic music playing]

301
00:35:34,966 --> 00:35:39,971
Lily! Stop that! Let go of me! Lily!

302
00:35:40,054 --> 00:35:41,264
-Who sent you here?
-Lily!

303
00:35:43,141 --> 00:35:44,308
-Mom!
-Lily!

304
00:35:44,392 --> 00:35:46,978
[suspenseful music]

305
00:35:47,061 --> 00:35:47,854
Lily!

306
00:35:50,857 --> 00:35:51,983
-[Lily] Diego.
-[Camia] Lily!

307
00:35:52,066 --> 00:35:53,317
Diego.

308
00:35:56,070 --> 00:35:59,824
[Camia shouting] Lily! Let me go! Lily!

309
00:35:59,907 --> 00:36:03,911
-Hurry!
-Lily! Lily! Let go of me!

310
00:36:06,956 --> 00:36:08,291
Camia!

311
00:36:09,083 --> 00:36:10,126
[Damian] Camia!

312
00:36:11,335 --> 00:36:13,171
-Camia!
-[gunshot]

313
00:36:22,638 --> 00:36:23,598
Hurry! Let's go!

314
00:36:25,433 --> 00:36:29,312
[suspenseful music playing]

315
00:36:57,173 --> 00:36:59,300
[ominous music]

316
00:37:08,226 --> 00:37:10,228
You're mine now.

317
00:37:10,311 --> 00:37:13,397
[suspenseful music playing]

318
00:38:12,832 --> 00:38:15,084
[tense music playing]

319
00:38:36,272 --> 00:38:37,398
Lily?

320
00:38:39,233 --> 00:38:40,318
-Auntie?
-Diego!

321
00:38:41,360 --> 00:38:42,653
-Diego!
-Lily!

322
00:38:45,239 --> 00:38:46,198
[grunts]

323
00:38:47,408 --> 00:38:49,452
-Mr. Damian!
-I've been shot.

324
00:38:49,910 --> 00:38:52,955
-Careful now.
-Diego.

325
00:38:53,539 --> 00:38:55,624
Find Lily and Camia
at the Ardientes' place.

326
00:38:56,959 --> 00:38:59,587
I'll look for them
at Red Dragon's den! Go!

327
00:39:03,883 --> 00:39:06,093
[engine roaring]

328
00:39:19,899 --> 00:39:21,776
You, guard the other room. And you--

329
00:39:21,859 --> 00:39:22,902
Lily!

330
00:39:23,319 --> 00:39:24,570
Why did you let him in?!

331
00:39:25,279 --> 00:39:26,947
-Lily! Auntie Camia!
-Stop there!

332
00:39:27,907 --> 00:39:28,908
-Let go of me!
-Sir, enough!

333
00:39:28,991 --> 00:39:29,742
Stop him!

334
00:39:29,825 --> 00:39:32,953
Damn you, Ardientes!
Where are they?! Lily!

335
00:39:33,037 --> 00:39:34,038
You won't shut up?!

336
00:39:34,914 --> 00:39:36,332
-Lily!
-They're not here!

337
00:39:36,415 --> 00:39:37,583
-Auntie Camia!
-Sir!

338
00:39:37,666 --> 00:39:38,876
-Go on!
-Get him out of here!

339
00:39:38,959 --> 00:39:42,797
Go on! Kill me! Lily! You bastards!

340
00:39:42,880 --> 00:39:44,423
Let Lily go! Now! Lily!

341
00:39:45,132 --> 00:39:48,219
What?! You idiot! What were
you going to do to my son?!

342
00:39:48,302 --> 00:39:51,597
-Lily! Auntie Camia!
-What?! Hey! Let go of my son!

343
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:52,681
Get out of here!

344
00:39:54,475 --> 00:39:55,559
[man] Let's go!

345
00:39:55,643 --> 00:39:57,603
[Diego breathing heavily]

346
00:39:58,396 --> 00:39:59,397
[door closes]

347
00:40:01,565 --> 00:40:03,776
Dad, where are Lily and Auntie Camia?

348
00:40:04,777 --> 00:40:06,028
Where are they?

349
00:40:08,697 --> 00:40:10,908
I don't know, son. I have no idea.

350
00:40:10,991 --> 00:40:13,244
-Don't lie to me.
-I really don't know.

351
00:40:13,327 --> 00:40:14,370
The Ardientes aren't here either.

352
00:40:14,453 --> 00:40:16,705
Then, where are they?
They took Lily and Aunt Camia!

353
00:40:16,789 --> 00:40:18,499
I said I don't know! I don't know!

354
00:40:18,582 --> 00:40:19,834
Then you're useless!

355
00:40:20,543 --> 00:40:23,379
Diego! Where are you going?!

356
00:40:24,839 --> 00:40:26,048
I'll look for them.

357
00:40:28,217 --> 00:40:31,053
I'll get Lily and Auntie Camia back.

358
00:40:35,391 --> 00:40:36,725
What happened to you, son?!

359
00:40:38,477 --> 00:40:40,020
Why are you acting like this?

360
00:40:40,813 --> 00:40:44,233
What happened to me?
Why am I acting like this?!

361
00:40:45,025 --> 00:40:46,986
They've taken everything away from me.

362
00:40:47,862 --> 00:40:50,364
I'm not letting them take Lily
from me too.

363
00:40:52,491 --> 00:40:53,492
I won't let them.

364
00:40:55,161 --> 00:40:56,495
Listen to me, Diego.

365
00:40:57,621 --> 00:40:59,457
I know why you're acting this way.

366
00:41:00,458 --> 00:41:01,292
I do.

367
00:41:05,045 --> 00:41:06,380
This is all my fault.

368
00:41:09,842 --> 00:41:11,093
Forgive me.

369
00:41:12,261 --> 00:41:13,387
Please, forgive me.

370
00:41:15,681 --> 00:41:16,724
I'm begging you…

371
00:41:18,017 --> 00:41:19,560
Don't do anything rash.

372
00:41:21,353 --> 00:41:23,063
I don't want anything bad
to happen to you.

373
00:41:24,482 --> 00:41:28,027
I promise I won't let you down
this time. I'll help you.

374
00:41:28,402 --> 00:41:31,572
I'll help you find them, all right?

375
00:42:05,940 --> 00:42:07,066
[Julio scoffs]

376
00:42:07,149 --> 00:42:08,150
[Julio] Oh.

377
00:42:13,405 --> 00:42:14,949
What's up, my boy?

378
00:42:19,203 --> 00:42:22,540
[Julio] My son. My son of a gun!

379
00:42:23,040 --> 00:42:25,209
You did good!

380
00:42:25,292 --> 00:42:27,753
You did very, very good!

381
00:42:27,836 --> 00:42:31,340
-Is she dead?
-Not yet, but she will be.

382
00:42:31,423 --> 00:42:32,466
Aw.

383
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:38,556
Now, who is going to put
a bullet into Lily Cruz?

384
00:42:38,639 --> 00:42:39,932
Me, I volunteer!

385
00:42:40,015 --> 00:42:42,935
[scoffs] Baby girl, that's too easy.

386
00:42:45,396 --> 00:42:49,316
After everything that Lily Cruz
has put our family through,

387
00:42:49,400 --> 00:42:51,610
she deserves to suffer!

388
00:42:56,574 --> 00:42:57,908
<i>-Monster!</i>
<i>-I didn't mean it.</i>

389
00:42:57,992 --> 00:42:58,993
<i>-You bastard!</i>
<i>-I don't love you!</i>

390
00:42:59,076 --> 00:43:01,328
<i>-You love me.</i>
<i>-I don't love you!</i>

391
00:43:01,829 --> 00:43:04,039
<i>-Mom.</i>
<i>-Lily, dear.</i>

392
00:43:05,124 --> 00:43:07,668
[Arnaldo] <i>Tell me.</i>
<i>You are Lily Cruz, right?</i>

393
00:43:07,751 --> 00:43:12,965
<i>-Answer me!</i>
<i>-Yes! I am! I am Lily Cruz!</i>

394
00:43:13,048 --> 00:43:14,967
-[Arnaldo and Lily scream]
-[gunshot]

395
00:43:26,061 --> 00:43:27,396
<i>-Emilia, that's enough!</i>
<i>-You can cross anyone,</i>

396
00:43:27,479 --> 00:43:28,772
<i>but not me!</i>

397
00:43:28,856 --> 00:43:32,985
<i>I'm not playing games with you!</i>
<i>Remember this, Emilia.</i>

398
00:43:33,611 --> 00:43:35,779
<i>Remember this!</i>

399
00:43:36,655 --> 00:43:39,658
<i>That's the last time you'll ever</i>
<i>get a chance to finish me off.</i>

400
00:43:39,867 --> 00:43:41,744
<i>I won't hesitate to kill you.</i>

401
00:43:42,077 --> 00:43:43,370
[police officer] <i>Emilia Torillo.</i>

402
00:43:43,454 --> 00:43:45,289
<i>You are under arrest for plunder.</i>

403
00:43:45,372 --> 00:43:49,585
<i>You can't do this to me!</i>
<i>Don't you know who I am?!</i>

404
00:43:49,668 --> 00:43:51,629
<i>I'm Emilia Ardiente!</i>

405
00:43:59,011 --> 00:44:01,847
[Diego] <i>Julio Ardiente!</i>
<i>I believe this is your money.</i>

406
00:44:01,930 --> 00:44:04,433
<i>The money you used</i>
<i>to bribe Secretary Martel!</i>

407
00:44:04,516 --> 00:44:09,104
<i>This is justice served</i>
<i>by the hand of Lily Cruz.</i>

408
00:44:10,939 --> 00:44:13,400
[in Spanish] <i>Farewell, old man!</i>

409
00:44:20,115 --> 00:44:23,118
We will break her heart
while it's still beating.

410
00:44:23,202 --> 00:44:25,204
[suspenseful music playing]

411
00:44:42,638 --> 00:44:44,640
[whipping]

412
00:44:53,524 --> 00:44:54,650
[Lily groans]

413
00:44:57,111 --> 00:45:00,489
[Helena] <i>We won't allow her to die</i>
<i>even if she begs for it!</i>

414
00:45:00,572 --> 00:45:02,866
-[whipping]
-[Lily groaning]

415
00:45:04,243 --> 00:45:05,285
[Lily grunts]

416
00:45:09,665 --> 00:45:12,584
<i>What now, Lily Cruz?! Didn't I tell you?</i>

417
00:45:12,668 --> 00:45:15,671
<i>If you play with a dragon's flame,</i>
<i>you'll get burned!</i>

418
00:45:16,922 --> 00:45:18,465
<i>Now, die!</i>

419
00:45:19,425 --> 00:45:20,968
[laughs]

420
00:45:26,223 --> 00:45:28,684
[Lily screams]

421
00:45:34,022 --> 00:45:35,607
And when the fire dies down,

422
00:45:36,733 --> 00:45:40,696
even her soul will bleed to death!

423
00:45:42,781 --> 00:45:44,408
You're so cruel.

424
00:45:45,576 --> 00:45:46,660
Harsh.

425
00:45:48,704 --> 00:45:50,664
[suspenseful music playing]

426
00:46:32,581 --> 00:46:35,459
[Helena] <i>I didn't take</i>
<i>your resignation very well.</i>

427
00:46:35,542 --> 00:46:39,713
<i>Once you're in, the only way out is death.</i>

428
00:46:39,796 --> 00:46:42,090
[Julio] <i>I'll be sending you an address.</i>

429
00:46:42,174 --> 00:46:45,469
<i>You have to be there within 20 minutes.</i>

430
00:46:45,552 --> 00:46:48,680
<i>Because if not,</i>
<i>your precious love will die.</i>

431
00:46:48,764 --> 00:46:50,098
<i>Let them go!</i>

432
00:46:50,641 --> 00:46:53,435
[Helena] <i>If neither of you dies</i>
<i>within eight hours,</i>

433
00:46:53,519 --> 00:46:57,689
<i>Lily and Camia will both die.</i>

434
00:46:57,773 --> 00:47:01,443
<i>Only one of them can survive!</i>
<i>And only one of us can die!</i>

435
00:47:01,527 --> 00:47:02,903
<i>And that's you!</i>

436
00:47:02,986 --> 00:47:05,572
[theme music playing]
